#: resources/settings/color_settings.glade:949
msgid ""
"Ride a bright head on the instantaneous positive crest so wave motion reads "
"along each wire."
msgstr ""
"Sõidutab heleda pea hetkelisel positiivsel harjal, nii et laine liikumine on "
"igal traadil loetav."

